'''Kyoto''' (京都 ''Kyōto'') was the capital of Japan for over a thousand years.
== Understand ==
Most sights are temples, shrines and gardens spread around the edge of the basin.
== See ==
=== Southern Higashiyama ===
* {{see | name=Kiyomizu-dera | alt=清水寺 | url=https://www.kiyomizudera.or.jp/en/ | lat=34.9949 | long=135.7850 | hours=6AM-6PM | price=¥400 | content=A wooden temple whose stage stands out over the hillside.}}
* {{see | name=Fushimi Inari Taisha | alt=伏見稲荷大社 | url=https://inari.jp/en/ | lat=34.9671 | long=135.7727 | content=Thousands of vermilion torii gates climb Mount Inari.}}
=== Northwest ===
* {{see | name=Kinkaku-ji | alt=金閣寺 | lat=35.0939 | long=135.7292 | content=The Golden Pavilion, covered in gold leaf.}}
* {{see | name=Nijō Castle | alt=二条城 | lat=35.0142 | long=135.7482 | content=Shogun's palace with nightingale floors.}}
=== Northern Higashiyama ===
* {{see | name=Ginkaku-ji | alt=銀閣寺 | content=The Silver Pavilion and its raked sand garden.}}
== Do ==
* {{do | name=Arashiyama Bamboo Grove | alt=嵐山竹林の小径 | lat=35.0170 | long=135.6713 | content=A path through tall bamboo.}}
* {{do | name= | content=A listing whose name was never filled in.}}
== Eat ==
* {{eat | name=Shigetsu | alt=篩月 | lat=35.0157 | long=135.6738 | price=¥3,300 | content=Buddhist vegetarian meals inside Tenryu-ji.}}
== Sleep ==
* {{sleep | name=Hotel Granvia Kyoto | lat=34.9853 | long=135.7584 | price=¥25,000 | content=Above the station.}}
* {{sleep | name=Guest House Waraku-an | address=Higashiyama | price=¥4,500 dorm | content=Small guesthouse.}}
== Go next ==
* [[Nara]] is an hour away by train.

'''Tokyo''' (東京 ''Tōkyō'') is Japan's capital.
== See ==
=== Asakusa ===
* {{see | name=Senso-ji | alt=浅草寺 | lat=35.7148 | long=139.7967 | content=The city's oldest temple.}}
* {{see | name=Asakusa Shrine | alt=浅草神社 | lat=35.7153 | long=139.7978 | content=A small shrine beside the temple.}}
=== West ===
* {{see | name=Ghibli Museum | alt=三鷹の森ジブリ美術館 | lat=35.6962 | long=139.5704 | content=Tickets must be bought in advance.}}
* {{see | name=Meiji Shrine | alt=明治神宮 | lat=35.6764 | long=139.6693 | content=Forest shrine next to Harajuku.}}
* {{see | name=Tokyo Tower | alt=東京タワー | lat=35.6586 | long=139.7454 | content=Red lattice tower.}}
* {{see | name=Tokyo Skytree | alt=東京スカイツリー | content=The tallest tower in Japan.}}
== Sleep ==
* {{sleep | name=Sakura Hostel Asakusa | address=Asakusa | content=Dorms and private rooms; no published rate.}}
* {{sleep | name=Hotel Gracery Shinjuku | address=Kabukicho | content=Godzilla on the roof.}}

